"roadside floral communities impact",                      6L,
"winter-active flower visitors",                           6L,
"contribution that sown flowers make to the pollen diets", 6L,
"pollen foraging diets of wild solitary bees",             6L,
# 7. Pollinisation / efficacité
"floral behavior of a. californica",                       7L,
"effect of pollinators on pollination along a drought",    7L,
"pollinator limitation in seven crops",                    7L,
"non-bee visitors are probable pollinators",               7L,
